1. `parser`, dates read month first: [#4](https://github.com/kulfix/mega-what-it-shows/issues/4)
2. `hint`, booking-v3 asks for the month first: [#5](https://github.com/kulfix/mega-what-it-shows/issues/5)
3. one-day moves: [#6](https://github.com/kulfix/mega-what-it-shows/issues/6)

